Known limitations / honest release notes
  ZAP is passive and unauthenticated from /health; Safe API receipts are not called DAST.
  Keycloak start-dev, local HTTP and process-local rate limiters are lab controls, not production deployment.
  PII and injection regexes are bounded to documented fixture classes and may have false positives/negatives outside the dataset.
